Councilmember Charelian commented on how he appreciated the comments by Martha Andreani regarding Agenda Item No. 5, and asked about any plans regarding the preservation of historical documents.\line\line Parks and Recreation Director Mark Leyman responded that the library needed assessment and staff was looking at long-term solutions in addition with HAI (consultant) was assisting in the preservation of the digital collection.\line\line Kristin Long - Historical Society Trailer (Item No. 5)\line\line\pard Seeing no further requests to speak, Mayor Howorth closed the floor to public comments.\cf1\i0\f1\par
